You might have to offer a better deal than that. You know, in case of the number 13, I discovered that, you know, most hotels, don't have a 13th floor. You sort of made reference to that in your introduction. And of course, they do, but they just don't number it 13. There was a study done that showed that approximately 80% of the buildings in New York City that could have a 13th floor don't. And I think that's a straight economic decision, a business decision, that it makes it easier to rent the hotel rooms or

