Can you just talk about him because I'm not sure that all our listeners know what Wade Boggs used to go through. Yeah. kept help to keep the you know Wade Boggs alive as a memory he's long he's long since retired from baseball but he was a he was a third basement uh for both the red sox and the yankees which is quite a trick when you think about it and uh he he was an he was a very good hitter he was he won the batting title several times and he is in the hall of fame uh but he was probably one of the most superstitious athletes you know ever and that's saying something that's because athletes really are superstitious. But in high school, he had a chicken dinner or chicken for

